      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A series of N-benzyl tetrahydropiperidinylidene pyrrolidinium salts have been synthesized and investigated for their antiplasmodial and antitrypanosomal activities as well as for their cytotoxic effects. The antibacterial, antimycobacterial and anticancer potencies of selected compounds were examined, too. Physicochemical parameters were calculated and structure-activity-relationships are discussed."
      },
